---
import { relay } from '../../data/site';

const plantLibraryUrl = new URL('/plants', relay.signInUrl).href;
const signupUrl = relay.signupUrl;

/* Preserve the existing Service Notifications pain-point icons. */
const icons = {
  copy: 'M20 9H11a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v9a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h9a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2zM5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1',
  calendarX: 'M19 4H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2zM16 2v4M8 2v4M3 10h18M14 14l-4 4M10 14l4 4',
  sliders: 'M4 21v-7M4 10V3M12 21v-9M12 8V3M20 21v-5M20 12V3M1 14h6M9 8h6M17 16h6',
};
---

<header class="mk-hero">
  <div class="mk-container"><div class="mk-hero__grid">
    <div class="mk-hero__copy">
      <p class="mk-eyebrow">Miri Relay</p>
      <h1 class="mk-display">Extend What’s Possible with Aspire</h1>
      <p class="mk-lead">Relay is a growing suite of tools built around the Aspire data your team already maintains, helping you improve communication, streamline recurring work, and get more value from the software your business already relies on.</p>
      <div class="mk-btn-row"><a href="#available-now" class="mk-btn mk-btn--primary">Explore Relay</a><a href={plantLibraryUrl} class="mk-btn mk-btn--secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Free Plant Library</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="mk-hero__figure products-spotlight">
      <div><p class="mk-eyebrow">FEATURE SPOTLIGHT</p><h2 class="mk-h4">Service Notifications</h2></div>
      <figure class="mk-chat">
                <div class="mk-chat__head">
                  <span class="mk-chat__avatar" aria-hidden="true">R</span>
                  <span class="mk-chat__who">
                    Northside Landscape
                    <span class="mk-chat__meta">Tomorrow · 3 services · 1 text</span>
                  </span>
                </div>
                <div class="mk-chat__body">
                  <p class="mk-chat__bubble mk-chat__bubble--out">
                    Hi Dana, just a reminder that your Routine Maintenance, Spring Clean, and Round 3 Turf Application are scheduled for tomorrow. Thank you!
                  </p>
                  <p class="mk-chat__stamp">Scheduled for 4:00 PM today</p>
                </div>
              </figure>
    </div>
  </div></div>
</header>
<section class="mk-section mk-section--sand" aria-label="Relay capabilities"><div class="mk-container"><div class="mk-grid mk-grid--3"><article class="mk-card products-capability"><svg class="products-line-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20 4c-7-2-15 1-15 8a6 6 0 0 0 6 6c7 0 9-7 9-14Z"/><path d="M4 21 14 11"/></svg><h2 class="mk-eyebrow">FREE PLANT LIBRARY</h2><p class="mk-body">Browse 15,000+ plants, save reusable palettes, create client PDFs, and build Aspire-ready item sheets.</p></article>
<article class="mk-card products-capability"><svg class="products-line-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M21 11a8 8 0 0 1-8 8H7l-4 3V7a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h6a8 8 0 0 1 8 8Z"/><path d="M8 9h8M8 13h5"/></svg><h2 class="mk-eyebrow">ADVANCED SMS COMMUNICATION</h2><p class="mk-body">Turn Aspire schedules and contact data into service notifications, customer updates, and team messages.</p></article>
<article class="mk-card products-capability"><svg class="products-line-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m10 3 2.5 6.5L19 12l-6.5 2.5L10 21l-2.5-6.5L1 12l6.5-2.5L10 3ZM20 2v6m-3-3h6"/></svg><h2 class="mk-eyebrow">BUILT TO EXPAND</h2><p class="mk-body">Relay is growing with new tools for invoice reminders, proposal follow-ups, recurring workflows, role-based reporting, AI insights, and more.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section id="available-now" class="mk-section"><div class="mk-container">
  <div class="mk-section-head mk-section-head--center"><p class="mk-eyebrow">Relay tools</p><h2 class="mk-h2">Available Now</h2></div>
  <div class="mk-grid mk-grid--3 products-tools">
    <a class="mk-card mk-card--interactive" href="#plant-library"><h3 class="mk-h3">Plant Library</h3><p class="mk-body">Find, save, share, and build Aspire-ready plant lists.</p><span class="mk-link">Explore Plant Library →</span></a>
    <a class="mk-card mk-card--interactive" href="#service-notifications"><h3 class="mk-h3">Service Notifications</h3><p class="mk-body">Customer communication tied to scheduled Aspire work.</p><span class="mk-link">Explore Service Notifications →</span></a>
    <a class="mk-card mk-card--interactive" href="#directory"><h3 class="mk-h3">Directory</h3><p class="mk-body">Communication outside of a scheduled visit.</p><span class="mk-link">Explore Directory →</span></a>
  </div>
</div></section>
<section id="service-notifications" class="mk-section mk-section--sand"><div class="mk-container">
  <div class="mk-section-head mk-section-head--wide"><p class="mk-eyebrow">Service Notifications</p><h2 class="mk-h2">Your schedule. Your message. Your control.</h2><p class="mk-lead">Review your Aspire schedule, choose the visits, customize the message, and send pre- or post-service notifications with control over exactly what your customers receive.</p></div>
  <div class="mk-grid mk-grid--4"><article class="mk-card"><h3 class="mk-h4">High-End Residential</h3><p class="mk-body">Give customers advance notice before crews arrive for maintenance, enhancements, or other scheduled work.</p></article>
<article class="mk-card"><h3 class="mk-h4">Plant Health Care</h3><p class="mk-body">Notify customers about upcoming chemical applications, treatments, or other services where advance communication matters.</p></article>
<article class="mk-card"><h3 class="mk-h4">Commercial Properties</h3><p class="mk-body">Keep detail-oriented property managers informed about upcoming scheduled services.</p></article>
<article class="mk-card"><h3 class="mk-h4">Snow Service</h3><p class="mk-body">Send service or dispatch notifications tied directly to scheduled snow work in Aspire.</p></article></div>
</div></section>
<section class="mk-section">
  <div class="mk-container">
    <div class="mk-section-head mk-section-head--center">
      <p class="mk-eyebrow">Why we built it</p>
      <h2 class="mk-h2">Native Aspire notifications get turned off</h2>
      <p class="mk-lead">
        Aspire already has SMS service notifications. Many companies try them, get frustrated, and
        eventually switch them off. Three reasons come up again and again.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mk-grid mk-grid--3">
      <article class="mk-card">
        <span class="mk-icon mk-icon--coral" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d={icons.copy} /></svg>
        </span>
        <h3 class="mk-h4">Multiple services mean multiple texts</h3>
        <p class="mk-body">
          If a customer has several work tickets scheduled for the same day, Aspire sends a
          separate notification for each one.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="mk-card">
        <span class="mk-icon mk-icon--coral" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d={icons.calendarX} /></svg>
        </span>
        <h3 class="mk-h4">Moving a ticket can trigger a cancellation</h3>
        <p class="mk-body">
          Reschedule on the Schedule Board and Aspire tells the customer the visit was cancelled.
          You cannot customize that message before it goes out.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="mk-card">
        <span class="mk-icon mk-icon--coral" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d={icons.sliders} /></svg>
        </span>
        <h3 class="mk-h4">Notifications are all or nothing</h3>
        <p class="mk-body">
          There is little control over which services generate a notification. A customer may want
          advance notice for spray applications and mulch, but not for weekly mowing.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="mk-callout mk-prose mk-prose--center products-callout">
      <span class="mk-callout__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p>Relay was built to give your team the control Aspire’s native notifications are missing.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="mk-section mk-section--sand">
  <div class="mk-container">
    <div class="mk-section-head mk-section-head--center">
      <p class="mk-eyebrow">How it works</p><h2 class="mk-h2">Three steps. Your team stays in control.</h2>
      <p class="mk-lead">Multiple services scheduled at the same property can be consolidated into one clean customer message.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="mk-steps">
      <li class="mk-step"><h3 class="mk-h4">Sync Your Aspire Schedule</h3><p class="mk-body">Relay pulls the upcoming schedule, properties, services, and contacts from Aspire.</p></li>
      <li class="mk-step"><h3 class="mk-h4">Review and Customize</h3><p class="mk-body">Choose which visits and contacts should receive notifications and apply the appropriate message templates.</p></li>
      <li class="mk-step"><h3 class="mk-h4">Send or Schedule</h3><p class="mk-body">Review the consolidated notification and send it now or schedule it for later.</p></li>
    </ol>
    <p class="mk-small products-setup">SMS setup: your existing Aspire organization, plus Quo or Dialpad for SMS delivery.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section id="directory" class="mk-section"><div class="mk-container">
  <div class="mk-section-head mk-section-head--wide"><p class="mk-eyebrow">Directory</p><h2 class="mk-h2">Reach the right people, even when there isn’t a scheduled visit.</h2><p class="mk-lead">Send one-off or scheduled texts to customers, employees, subcontractors, and other contacts using the information you already maintain in Aspire.</p><p class="mk-body products-distinction">Service Notifications handles communication tied to scheduled Aspire work. Directory handles communication that needs to happen outside of a scheduled visit.</p></div>
  <div class="mk-grid mk-grid--3"><article class="mk-card products-example"><h3 class="mk-eyebrow">STORM OUTLOOK</h3><p class="mk-body">Customer communication before snow even begins.</p><blockquote>A winter storm is expected later this week. We're monitoring the forecast closely and will keep you updated as conditions develop.</blockquote></article>
<article class="mk-card products-example"><h3 class="mk-eyebrow">POST-STORM UPDATE</h3><p class="mk-body">Give customers an update after the event, beyond individual service visits.</p><blockquote>The storm has passed and our crews are completing final checks. We'll continue monitoring conditions and will update you if additional service is needed.</blockquote></article>
<article class="mk-card products-example"><h3 class="mk-eyebrow">EMPLOYEE REMINDERS</h3><p class="mk-body">Company-wide administrative communication.</p><blockquote>Reminder: Benefits enrollment paperwork needs to be submitted by Friday.</blockquote></article>
<article class="mk-card products-example"><h3 class="mk-eyebrow">WEATHER DELAYS</h3><p class="mk-body">Operational updates to field employees or crews.</p><blockquote>Rain is expected through 11 AM. Please do not report to the office until noon today.</blockquote></article>
<article class="mk-card products-example"><h3 class="mk-eyebrow">SUBCONTRACTOR REQUIREMENTS</h3><p class="mk-body">Requirements and deadlines for groups of subcontractors.</p><blockquote>All subcontractors who want to participate in snow services this season need to submit proof of insurance and required tax paperwork by Friday.</blockquote></article><article class="mk-card products-example"><h3 class="mk-eyebrow">CUSTOMER ANNOUNCEMENTS</h3><p class="mk-body">Customer communications beyond a specific work ticket.</p><ul class="products-announcements"><li>Seasonal promotions, such as discounts on seasonal color proposals</li><li>Local watering restrictions</li><li>Weather-related notices</li><li>Seasonal operational updates</li><li>Office or holiday announcements</li></ul></article></div>
</div></section>
<section id="plant-library" class="mk-section mk-section--sand"><div class="mk-container">
  <div class="mk-section-head mk-section-head--wide"><p class="mk-eyebrow">Plant Library</p><h2 class="mk-h2">Find the right plants. Put them to work.</h2><p class="mk-lead">Explore 15,000+ plants with photos and detailed growing information.</p></div>
  <div class="mk-grid mk-grid--4 products-plant-benefits"><article class="mk-card"><h3 class="mk-h4">LEARN & DISCOVER</h3><p class="mk-body">Explore new plants and filter to find options for your sun, water, and climate.</p></article>
<article class="mk-card"><h3 class="mk-h4">SAVE YOUR FAVORITES</h3><p class="mk-body">Build reusable palettes by design style, project, or company favorites.</p></article>
<article class="mk-card"><h3 class="mk-h4">SHARE WITH CLIENTS</h3><p class="mk-body">Export photo-rich PDFs to present plant palettes with confidence.</p></article>
<article class="mk-card"><h3 class="mk-h4">PRICE & IMPORT</h3><p class="mk-body">Export plant lists in Aspire’s import format for vendor pricing and availability.</p></article></div>
  <div class="products-plant-cta"><p class="mk-h3">All these tools. Included with your free account.</p><a href={plantLibraryUrl} class="mk-btn mk-btn--primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Free Plant Library</a></div>
</div></section>
<section id="roadmap" class="mk-section"><div class="mk-container">
  <div class="mk-section-head mk-section-head--wide"><p class="mk-eyebrow">BUILT TO EXPAND</p><h2 class="mk-h2">Relay keeps growing around the work your team already does.</h2><p class="mk-lead">New Relay tools are already in development to put more of your Aspire data to work.</p></div>
  <div class="mk-grid mk-grid--3"><article class="mk-card mk-card--sand"><span class="products-coming-soon">Coming Soon</span><h3 class="mk-h4">Invoice Reminders</h3><p class="mk-body">Follow up on outstanding invoices without chasing them manually. Send timely reminders based on billing status.</p></article>
<article class="mk-card mk-card--sand"><span class="products-coming-soon">Coming Soon</span><h3 class="mk-h4">Proposal Follow-Ups</h3><p class="mk-body">Keep proposals from going cold with timely follow-ups after an estimate is sent.</p></article>
<article class="mk-card mk-card--sand"><span class="products-coming-soon">Coming Soon</span><h3 class="mk-h4">Recurring Aspire Issues / Tasks</h3><p class="mk-body">Create Aspire issues automatically on a recurring cadence for admin processes, property tasks, inspections, and recurring team responsibilities.</p></article>
<article class="mk-card mk-card--sand"><span class="products-coming-soon">Coming Soon</span><h3 class="mk-h4">Role-Based Reports</h3><p class="mk-body">Turn Aspire data into recurring reports for specific roles and deliver the information directly to the people who need it.</p></article>
<article class="mk-card mk-card--sand"><span class="products-coming-soon">Coming Soon</span><h3 class="mk-h4">AI Insights</h3><p class="mk-body">Surface accounts, jobs, and trends that need attention before they become problems.</p></article></div>
</div></section>
<section id="pricing" class="mk-section mk-section--sand"><div class="mk-container">
  <div class="mk-section-head mk-section-head--center"><p class="mk-eyebrow">Pricing</p><h2 class="mk-h2">Choose the Relay tools that fit your team.</h2></div>
  <div class="mk-grid mk-grid--2 products-pricing">
    <article class="mk-card products-bundle"><span class="products-value-badge">Best Value · Save $100/mo</span><h3 class="mk-h3">Service Notifications + Directory</h3><p class="products-price">$350<span>/mo</span></p><p class="mk-body">Get both Relay messaging tools in one bundle. Use Service Notifications for communication tied to scheduled work and Directory for everything that happens outside the schedule.</p></article>
    <article class="mk-card"><h3 class="mk-h3">Service Notifications</h3><p class="products-price">$300<span>/mo</span></p><p class="mk-body">Pre- and post-service customer communication built around your Aspire schedule.</p></article>
    <article class="mk-card"><h3 class="mk-h3">Directory</h3><p class="products-price">$150<span>/mo</span></p><p class="mk-body">One-off and scheduled messaging to Aspire customers, employees, subcontractors, and other contacts.</p></article>
    <article class="mk-card"><h3 class="mk-h3">Plant Library</h3><p class="products-price">Free</p><p class="mk-body">Browse, save, share, and build Aspire-ready plant lists with a free Relay workspace.</p></article>
  </div>
</div></section>
<section class="mk-section"><div class="mk-container"><div class="mk-cta"><div class="mk-cta__inner">
  <h2 class="mk-h2">Aspire has the data. Miri helps you do more with it.</h2>
  <div class="mk-btn-row"><a href={signupUrl} class="mk-btn mk-btn--primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Explore Relay</a><a href={plantLibraryUrl} class="mk-btn mk-btn--secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Free Plant Library</a></div>
</div></div></div></section>
